##Listar Instância
aws ec2 describe-instances

---
## Iniciar Instância
aws ec2 start-instances --instance-ids i-xxxxxxxxxxxxx

---
## Parar Instância
aws ec2 stop-instances --instance-ids i-xxxxxxxxxxxxx

---
## Encerrar Instância
aws ec2 terminate-instances --instance-ids i-xxxxxxxxxxxxx

---
## Adicionar TAG à Instância
aws ec2 create-tags --resources i-xxxxxxxxxxxxx --tags Key=Ambiente,Value=Teste
